# Children under internal/ and external/ are independent git repos, never tracked here. This covers
# both the brains this harness mounts and the app repos it merely registers; the harness knows every
# one of them only through its repo-registry/ entry.
internal/*
!internal/README.md
external/*
!external/README.md

# Local per-machine config and runtime state.
.claude/brains.conf
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/mcp-servers.json

# Generated runtime layer: the copied command layer and the capability index, regenerated by /sync.
.claude/.copied-manifest
.claude/COPIED-FROM.md
.claude/CAPABILITIES.md
.claude/agents/
.claude/skills/
.claude/rules/
# Root-owned commands are versioned by the negations below. A negation missing here silently stops
# versioning that command; the set must match PROTECTED_COMMANDS in .claude/refresh-commands.sh.
.claude/commands/*
!.claude/commands/start.md
!.claude/commands/sync.md
!.claude/commands/save.md
!.claude/commands/promote-to-department.md
!.claude/commands/workspace-help.md
!.claude/commands/register-repo.md

# OS noise.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
